      "role": "user",
      "content": "i thought being alone would fix everything. i thought if i just cut everyone out and stopped trying, the noise would stop. but it's even worse now. it's just me and these four walls and i feel like im suffocating in the silence. i built this life to be safe but it just feels like a cage. there's no way out of this.",
