      "content": "It's true that a phone call can't magically erase the weight of what you're feeling, and that realization can make everything seem even more hopeless. But even if nothing changes externally, there is still the possibility of finding a small, manageable way to change how you feel internally. Think about what would be the absolute smallest, most insignificant thing you could do today that might offer a tiny break from the loop.",
